{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "zn15_43_size_abort_landfill_cost",
  "spec": [
    "zones 6",
    "zones 4",
    "landfill 4.3"
  ],
  "description": "ZG17 (\u00a76 notes, worked example): a failed size check is an ABORT, not an early return. No cell is examined, but the post-loop block runs: for type 14 the cost is the landfill developer's GetZoningCost of the whole request region (the world returns `landfill_cost`), 0 with skipFunds; a cost above the funds (signed int64) replaces error 3 or 4 with 1. Other types cost 0, so with negative funds they fail with error 1 too. A 1 \u00d7 1 landfill (min[14] = 2) with cost 36: error 3, cost 36, on a dry run and on a commit (nothing written). Cost 208 with funds 100: error 1; skipFunds: error 3, cost 0. A 33 \u00d7 2 landfill (max[14] = 32; the min check comes first, so the rect is 2 high): error 4, cost 208; with funds 0, error 1. A 1 \u00d7 1 agriculture zone (type 7, min 4): error 3, cost 0 with funds 0; error 1 with funds -1.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "zone_env",
      "cells": [
        64,
        64
      ],
      "landfill_cost": 36
    },
    {
      "op": "zone_create",
      "session": 0
    },
    {
      "op": "zone_init"
    },
    {
      "op": "zone_place_zone",
      "region": {
        "rect": [
          5,
          6,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      "type": 14,
      "commit": false,
      "skip_funds": false,
      "check_slope": true,
      "skip_size": false,
      "check_lot_inside": false,
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "error": 3,
        "cost": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "zone_place_zone",
      "region": {
        "rect": [
          5,
          6,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      "type": 14,
      "commit": true,
      "skip_funds": false,
      "check_slope": true,
      "skip_size": false,
      "check_lot_inside": false,
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "error": 3,
        "cost": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "zone_expect",
      "zones": [
        [
          5,
          6,
          0
        ]
      ]
    },
